// A queued auto job left by a restart is marked error. A done job stays done.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE orphan ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot PROTON 1

PLUG orphan law

IMPULSE orphan 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "orphan" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
